    "text": "Her cy\u00f0 ymbe \u00fea halgan \u00fee on Angelcynne resta\u00f0, on ures Drihtenes naman, h\u00e6lendes Cristes.\nSanctus Agustinus gefullode \u00c6\u00feelbriht Cantwarena cyningc and ealle his \u00feeode.\n\u00d0onne w\u00e6s Eadbald \u00c6\u00feelbrihtes sunu cynges, and Birihtan hatte his cwen.\nAnd \u00c6\u00feelburh hatte heora dohtor and o\u00f0re naman Tate, heo w\u00e6s forgifen Eadwine Nor\u00f0hymbra cyninge\nAnd heo \u00fea \u00e6fter Eadwines d\u00e6ge gesohte Cantwarabirig, and hire bro\u00f0or Eadbald w\u00e6s Cantwara\n\u00d0onne w\u00e6s Ymme, Eadbaldes cwen, Franca cynges dohtor, and hig begeaton sancte Eanswi\u00f0e, \u00fee \u00e6t\nAnd Eormenburh and sancte Eormengi\u00f0 and sancte \u00c6\u00feelred and sancte \u00c6\u00feelbriht \u00feis w\u00e6ron\n\u00d0onne w\u00e6s Ecgbriht cyningc and Lo\u00f0here cyningc and sancta Eormenhild and sancta Ercengota w\u00e6ron\n\u00deonne w\u00e6s sancte Eormenburge o\u00f0er nama Domne Eue, heo w\u00e6s forgifen Merwale, Pendan sunu\nHi \u00fea for Godes lufan tod\u00e6ldon be heom libbendum hi ged\u00e6ldon be him lybbendan eal \u00fe\u00e6t hi ahton;\n\u00d0unor hatte his gerefa, \u00fee hig acwellan het, and he hig bebirigde under \u00fe\u00e6s cynges heahsetle on\nAnd he \u00fea het heora swustor Domne Eue him to gefeccan, \u00fe\u00e6t heo heora wergilde onfon mihte and heo\nAnd heo \u00fea sancte Mildri\u00f0e, hire dohtor, ofer s\u00e6 s\u00e6nde, \u00fe\u00e6t heo \u00feone wisdom \u00fear geleornode, \u00fee man\nAnd heo \u00fea, sancte Mildry\u00f0, eft to hyre medder ham com, and heo hire \u00fea \u00fe\u00e6t mynster forgeaf, \u00fea hit\nAnd heo \u00fea \u00fear Gode to willan ge\u00feeah and \u00fe\u00e6t ece lif geearnode, and swa oft si\u00f0\u00f0an heora mihta cu\u00f0e\nAnd sancte Eormengi\u00f0, hyre moddrige, mid hire wunode o\u00f0 hire lifes ende and heo silf \u00fear hyre licreste\nAnd sancte Eadburh \u00fea to \u00feam mynstre fengc \u00e6fter sancte Myldri\u00f0e a